<title>POLAND: BPH Q2 net falls to PLN 69.6 mln.</title>
<headline>BPH Q2 net falls to PLN 69.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPH preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		   115.53    vs  95.02</p>
